    "Colleague 5": "Tackle the coalescent site frequency spectrum angle, emphasizing that finite large cohorts still suffer singleton loss.",
    "Colleague 12": "Ground the argument in practical bioinformatics pipelines and summary statistics (e.g., distortion of Tajima's D when singletons are truncated)."
  }
},
"my_action_for_round_1": {
  "stance": "Maintain C strongly.",
  "key_points_to_deliver": [
